6646 2025 11 03t09 39 05z cross referenc by pellar http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 2025 11 03t10 30 37z cross referenc by pellar http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7567 2025 11 04t06 03 36z referenc by pellar 2025 12 03t10 14 03z cross referenc by martincostello http github com open telemetri opentelemetri dotnet issu 6748 2025 12 11t17 47 55z cross referenc by pellar http github com open telemetri opentelemetri ebpf instrument issu 13 2026 01 07t18 28 05z renam by trask enabl immut releas where possibl recommend immut releas\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"0745ef188a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"id\": \"7377281fa62cd037\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.4446878211792689, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.30608601311324135, \"vector_similarity\": 0.76809204, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"0745ef188a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 6168, \"chunk_count\": 5, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:11\", \"token_count\": 2203, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Robert Pająk\\n\\n- David Ashpole\\n\\n- Mike Blum\\n\\n## Action Items\\n\\n- Robert:\\n\\n  - Work with GC to set up a maintainers mailing list for OSS-Fuzz notifications and ensure appropriate access for Go SIG maintainers.\\n\\n  - Consider manual recreation of older OSS-Fuzz issues if needed; revisit auto GitHub issue filing after triage process matures.\\n\\n  - Take ownership of otelhttp issue [#7254](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/7254); draft a document clarifying error marking approach and semconv alignment.\\n\\n  - Enable GitHub signature releases for OTel Go; update releasing docs; ensure artifacts are uploaded at release time and signatures published. Reference: [sig-security #164](https://github.com/open-telemetry/sig-security/issues/164).\\n\\n- Damien:\\n\\n  - Open an issue to kick off an audit of the otelhttp API for stabilization and coordinate reviews.\\n\\n- David (dashpole):\\n\\n  - Monitor semconv RPC stabilization efforts; once stable, drive otelgrpc module stabilization.\\n\\n  - Sync with Josh regarding gRPC team engagement; explore KubeCon conversations if feasible.\\n\\n- Mike:\\n\\n  - Iterate on the otel Explorer Go docs schema:\\n\\n    - Align with OTEL semantic conventions.\\n\\n    - Ensure Weaver compatibility.\\n\\n    - Provide a JSON Schema (or CUE) for validation.\\n\\n    - Consider linking instrumentations to existing semconv references.\\n\\n- Tyler:\\n\\n  - Assign relevant GitHub tasks/issues from this meeting.\\n\\n  - Confirm KubeCon schedule and cancel the Zoom SIG meeting during KubeCon week; share booth details with the community.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"robert paj ą k david ashpol mike blum action item robert work with gc to set up a maintain mail list for os fuzz notif and ensur appropri access for go sig maintain consid manual recreat of older os fuzz issu if need revisit auto github issu file after triag process matur take ownership of otelhttp issu 7254 http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 7254 draft a document clarifi error mark approach and semconv align enabl github signatur releas for otel go updat releas doc ensur artifact are upload at releas time and signatur publish refer sig secur 164 http github com open telemetri sig secur issu 164 damien open an issu to kick off an audit of the otelhttp api for s